  "reason": "The current best is config_021 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) at 0.7250 accuracy. All four aggregation×fusion combinations for that encoder pair are already tested, and scgpt/pca_n2000 encoders performed poorly (≤0.64). The closest untested variant in the high-performing neighborhood is config_013 (scvi_n200, resnet50, transformer, concat), which tests whether the concat fusion with resnet50+transformer might interact differently than the weighted variant (config_025, 0.7131). Based on the small weighted→concat penalty observed with vit_l (~0.004), I estimate config_013 at ~0.71, making it the highest-expected-accuracy untested configuration. While unlikely to surpass 0.7250, it completes the resnet50+transformer subgrid and provides the strongest remaining evidence for the search. Expected cost: ~5–6 GPU hours (similar to config_025's 6.22 hrs), moderate relative to the budget already spent (43.65 hrs total so far)."
}

